OL,3,GNEWSAStates consultant spend and hiring
OL,4,Aface changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew restrictions on the use of
OL,7,Fconsultants and hiring high-earning
OL,8,Fcivil servants will be put to
OL,9,FGuernsey's States this autumn.
OL,11,FDeputy David Goy has prepared eight
OL,12,Fproposals to alter Policy and
OL,13,FResources' (P&R) tax proposals, which
OL,14,Fare due to be debated at the States
OL,15,Fmeeting starting on 30 September.
OL,17,FHe has suggested there should be a
OL,18,F30-day notice period on the hiring of
OL,19,Fany consultants for Guernsey's States,
OL,20,Falongside a similar period for new
OL,21,Fcivil servant posts earning more than
OL,22,F#100,000 a year.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
