OL,3,GNEWSAStates consultant spend and hiring
OL,4,Aface changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FP&R has proposed a 3% goods and
OL,7,Fservices tax (GST), lower income tax
OL,8,Frates, higher income tax allowances,
OL,9,Fchanges to social security, motor tax
OL,10,Fand higher taxes on some companies.
